I know this might sound like a young love story, but I'm not being childish about it.

1841
01:59:00,560 --> 01:59:02,360
would be announced. And the rest is history. Wo aajkal aati na reel, ek message kar diti

1842
01:59:02,440 --> 01:59:15,499
I'm genuinely serious about him compared to the Pakistani men I've dated in the past,

1843
01:59:15,579 --> 01:59:17,460
most of whom.

1844
