In one way or the other, try to control how I spoke, dressed or behaved.

1845
01:59:22,880 --> 01:59:28,800
Being with him feels like a breath of fresh air. It's the first time I've felt seen and respected for who I am.

1846
01:59:28,880 --> 01:59:31,880
Honestly, I feel like I've struck gold with him.

1847
01:59:31,960 --> 01:59:36,120
Aam main yehi baat kar raha tha pishji sawaal mein. Perspective badalta hai.

1848
01:59:36,200 --> 01:59:41,100
From the start, we both knew that our relationship would come with challenges, cultural,

1849
01:59:41,180 --> 01:59:43,200
religious and eventually familial ones.

1850
01:59:43,280 --> 01:59:44,830
And of course, there's this elephant in the…

1851
01:59:44,910 --> 01:59:49,110
different in the room. The whole Muslim women can't marry outside their religion.

1852
01:59:49,190 --> 01:59:53,750
Debate. I've heard it all before, but I've always believed that faith is a personal journey,

1853
01:59:53,830 --> 01:59:56,232
not a boundary drawn drawn by others.

1854
01:59:56,312 --> 01:59:57,928
What I didn't expect, though,

1855
