So if Germany goes to shit, it's on me as well.

1982
02:07:43,190 --> 02:07:49,110
Yeah, but thank you. I am very happy that from that video, look how many people's lives have changed.

1983
02:07:49,190 --> 02:07:54,740
Although I did nothing. There were two boys. They were so kind enough. They came to meet me.

1984
02:07:54,820 --> 02:07:55,963
We were in Munich.

1985
02:07:56,043 --> 02:07:57,631
We were at Marine Splats.

1986
02:07:57,711 --> 02:07:58,584
Beautiful area.

1987
