And there is a huge church there.

1988
02:08:01,380 --> 02:08:03,540
So we were standing outside of it.

1989
02:08:03,620 --> 02:08:07,543
I made that video with the quality of a dirty Snapchat camera.

1990
02:08:07,623 --> 02:08:11,119
And it's one of the biggest videos that I've done.

1991
02:08:11,199 --> 02:08:13,485
Its thumbnail is so off, God forgive me.

1992
02:08:13,565 --> 02:08:14,708
It's so bad quality.

1993
02:08:14,788 --> 02:08:17,050
Yeah, we all evolve.

1994
