But because of that, not only Pakistanis but Indians and Bangladeshis.

1995
02:08:21,700 --> 02:08:25,740
Bangladeshi and even Nepali students ended up in Germany.

1996
02:08:25,820 --> 02:08:27,740
So, Alhamdulillah.

1997
02:08:27,820 --> 02:08:32,620
This is the reason that someone can easily make it in their life.

1998
02:08:32,700 --> 02:08:36,380
If you can make it in just four words, then what is the big deal?

1999
02:08:36,460 --> 02:08:40,620
So this is what religion is.

2000
02:08:40,700 --> 02:08:43,620
Religion is a beautiful thing. It's a way of life.

2001
02:08:43,700 --> 02:08:48,430
We have only understood prostration and staying hungry in Ramadan.

2002
02:08:48,510 --> 02:08:50,430
Religion is a way of life.

2003
02:08:50,510 --> 02:08:53,430
How many times do you create ease in people's lives?

2004
02:08:53,510 --> 02:08:58,430
Brother, removing a stone from the road is also a good deed.

2005
02:08:58,510 --> 02:09:03,430
It is the greatest good deed that you are removing someone's path.

2006
02:09:03,510 --> 02:09:06,430
So we don't pay attention to these things.

2007
02:09:06,510 --> 02:09:11,430
We have only adopted performative religion that can be shown.

2008
