2018
02:09:46,350 --> 02:09:50,510
The biggest pride of my life is that I wake up for fajr without an alarm.

2019
02:09:50,590 --> 02:09:52,710
Mawra Hussain.

2020
02:09:52,790 --> 02:09:55,030
Good for you.

2021
02:09:55,110 --> 02:09:58,230
So everyone, then you can watch in cricket in front of you.

2022
02:09:58,310 --> 02:09:59,750
There were a few more.

2023
02:09:59,830 --> 02:10:02,270
So, I don't know.

2024
02:10:02,350 --> 02:10:08,470
So when you keep things performative, then everyone will want to show that, look, I am so good.

2025
02:10:08,550 --> 02:10:11,550
And goodness is only yours.

2026
02:10:11,810 --> 02:10:18,630
It's your actions that will judge your actions.

2027
