You prayed for Allah but what did you do with the creatures of Allah?

2028
02:10:23,210 --> 02:10:24,899
Did you cheat?

2029
02:10:27,728 --> 02:10:30,141
Did you cheat anyone?

2030
02:10:30,221 --> 02:10:32,600
Did you hurt anyone?

2031
02:10:33,210 --> 02:10:35,830
So we don't take that humanity element.

2032
02:10:35,910 --> 02:10:37,110
So overall.

2033
02:10:37,580 --> 02:10:40,780
Pakistan is performative.

2034
02:10:40,860 --> 02:10:46,380
The Hajis are full in the market but don't pay anyone.

2035
02:10:46,460 --> 02:10:47,660
What can a person do?

2036
02:10:47,740 --> 02:10:52,500
So this hypocrisy, now, as you keep asking,

2037
02:10:52,580 --> 02:11:00,500
So as far as what you did in India, of course, on one hand, where we see a lot of,

2038
02:11:00,580 --> 02:11:04,430
obviously, Hindu-Muslim riots are also very…

2039
02:11:04,510 --> 02:11:06,430
There have been many incidents.

2040
