And same for the Haji Ali in Mumbai.

2043
02:11:19,510 --> 02:11:25,430
My friend, Nitin Mirani, whenever he is in Mumbai, he goes to Haji Ali.

2044
02:11:25,510 --> 02:11:30,510
And as far as we are concerned with the BJP.

2045
02:11:31,180 --> 02:11:32,158
It's not all of India.

2046
