2214
02:21:56,310 --> 02:21:58,278
Back in July this year, I visited Pakistan.

2215
02:21:58,358 --> 02:22:04,756
I reside in the Middle East and I went on a camping trip with my friends in Islamabad to Siripai Meadows in Kagan Valley.

2216
02:22:04,836 --> 02:22:09,069
I was supposed to be one of those boys and girls trip type of escapes, barbecue, bonfire,

2217
02:22:09,149 --> 02:22:12,570
speakers, blasting, someone pretending to play guitar, that sort of vibe.

2218
02:22:13,080 --> 02:22:19,880
The view was unreal, beautiful meadows, beautiful sky and pine trees whispering as if they were listening in on our laughter.

2219
02:22:21,360 --> 02:22:21,860
But something shifted that night. After the barbecue and the most of us had eaten way too much chicken bihari boti with bread and the night grew colder.

2220
02:22:33,800 --> 02:22:40,440
Someone brought out the blankets. We all huddled around the fire, talking nonsense at first. Who's dating who? Who's the funniest? Who's the most likely to get arrested? Until someone said, let's tell our secrets. No judging. Everyone laughed and.

2221
02:22:40,520 --> 02:22:42,853
and I thought it was just a banter.

2222
02:22:42,933 --> 02:22:46,343
The first story came from a guy I've known since we wore diapers.

2223
02:22:46,423 --> 02:22:55,897
He grinned like an idiot and confessed that he once hooked up with his younger cousin during a mehendi while their parents were in the next room discussing their mark sheets.

2224
02:22:55,977 --> 02:22:59,801
He said it so casually as if it was just a wild thing that happened.

2225
02:22:59,881 --> 02:23:01,316
Everyone turned to laughter.

2226
02:23:01,396 --> 02:23:04,316
He described how they'd sneak away during dance practice,

2227
02:23:04,396 --> 02:23:07,140
how it was nothing serious but just a dream getaway.

2228
02:23:07,320 --> 02:23:13,640
Everyone joked, bro, that's elite level, riske meh riske and laughed so hard that I laughed too, just to blend in.

2229
02:23:13,720 --> 02:23:15,322
But deep down it felt wrong.

2230
02:23:15,402 --> 02:23:17,346
And even in this age of awareness,

2231
02:23:17,426 --> 02:23:24,260
