2235
02:23:33,104 --> 02:23:35,410
They hit it off and he ended up sleeping with him.

2236
02:23:35,490 --> 02:23:37,482
with the Pakistani girl he met there.

2237
02:23:37,562 --> 02:23:39,124
He made it sound like a joke.

2238
02:23:39,204 --> 02:23:43,269
Imagine going all the way to Europe to find another Pakistani to sin with.

2239
02:23:43,349 --> 02:23:47,898
People cheered, someone shouted, Bhai, Amsterdam mein bhi apni biryani hi mil gayi.

2240
02:23:47,978 --> 02:23:50,710
And the laughter echoed through the night.

2241
02:23:50,790 --> 02:23:54,971
The third story, though that one changed the air completely,

2242
02:23:55,051 --> 02:23:57,071
