2243
02:23:57,151 --> 02:24:02,130
He said when he was younger, maybe around seventeen, an older cousin did stuff with him.

2244
02:24:02,270 --> 02:24:07,910
He said it in a half-joking way, called it Bachpan ki Masti, but there was something in his tone which was confusion.

2245
02:24:07,990 --> 02:24:14,630
Maybe that everyone ignored. They all just made awkward laughs trying to improve past it, but I couldn't.

2246
02:24:14,710 --> 02:24:20,310
But that story replayed in my head even after the fire went out.

2247
02:24:20,390 --> 02:24:26,870
Later a girl from our group confessed she once had feelings for her male games teacher back in school.

2248
02:24:26,950 --> 02:24:29,420
She said he caught her after class.

2249
02:24:29,500 --> 02:24:32,193
one day and they had a moment on the staircase.

2250
02:24:32,273 --> 02:24:33,396
A moment she enjoyed.

2251
02:24:33,476 --> 02:24:37,739
People who did called her bold, said things like, Miss hot teacher vibes.

2252
02:24:37,819 --> 02:24:43,616
She laughed like she wasn't assaulted since she was a minor who did things with a forty year old.

2253
02:24:43,696 --> 02:24:48,188
As more stories came, I started feeling like a stranger among my own friends.

2254
02:24:48,268 --> 02:24:50,954
It was as if I had entered a secret world.

2255
02:24:51,034 --> 02:24:54,415
One where people would, people carry, carried hidden scars,

2256
02:24:54,495 --> 02:24:56,580
forbidden pleasures and things that

2257
02:24:56,980 --> 02:24:57,827
Never said sober.

2258
02:24:57,907 --> 02:25:00,853
Everyone was laughing, but I felt small, almost naive.

2259
02:25:00,933 --> 02:25:03,828
You see, Junaid, I've never been with anyone.

2260
02:25:03,908 --> 02:25:06,581
I've never done drugs, never even kissed someone.

2261
02:25:06,661 --> 02:25:11,651
That night sitting next to that dying fire, I felt both proud and stupid at the same time.

2262
02:25:11,731 --> 02:25:14,702
Proud that I hadn't crossed certain lines and stupid,

2263
02:25:14,782 --> 02:25:19,902
done something stupid because everyone has had and they seemed completely fine about it.

2264
02:25:19,982 --> 02:25:23,950
Since that trip, I haven't been able to hang out with them the same way.

2265
02:25:24,030 --> 02:25:27,512
way every time I look at their faces I hear those stories.

2266
02:25:27,592 --> 02:25:30,800
It's not that I'm judging them, at least I don't want to.

2267
02:25:30,880 --> 02:25:33,898
It's just that I don't know how to unhear what I heard.

2268
02:25:33,978 --> 02:25:41,077
How do you look at your friends again when you've seen the part of them that laughs at something that sounds like inbreeding,

2269
02:25:41,157 --> 02:25:44,504
trauma, or something that treats intimacy like a party trick.

2270
02:25:44,584 --> 02:25:48,231
So I wanted to ask you, am I being too sensitive, too judgmental,

2271
02:25:48,311 --> 02:25:50,630
or is it just the reality of adulthood that

2272
02:25:50,710 --> 02:25:52,842
