2273
02:25:52,922 --> 02:25:55,333
That night in Seripai changed me.

2274
02:25:55,413 --> 02:25:58,346
The air was cold, but something inside me burned.

2275
02:25:58,426 --> 02:26:00,267
A mixture of discomfort, sadness,

2276
02:26:00,347 --> 02:26:04,735
and the strange realization that innocence is not something you lose once.

2277
02:26:04,815 --> 02:26:08,504
It slips away every time you learn what people are capable of.

2278
02:26:08,584 --> 02:26:12,390
If you ever read this, I'd genuinely love to hear your thoughts.

2279
02:26:12,470 --> 02:26:16,741
Maybe you just need someone to tell me that it's okay to feel like this.

2280
02:26:16,821 --> 02:26:17,200
Khuda Hafiz.

2281
02:26:17,280 --> 02:26:24,540
So as you heard, this is a boy who traveled from Midli to sit in Siri Pai.

2282
02:26:24,620 --> 02:26:29,780
And Siri Pai is also a place, not just a place to eat.

2283
02:26:29,860 --> 02:26:36,060
And then obviously when the young kids sit gathered around fire and then this kind of story.

2284
