Second thing is that just to act a little cool, some people do make up stories.

2287
02:26:52,000 --> 02:26:56,920
Like, it's not necessary that all the stories you heard there are all true.

2288
02:26:57,000 --> 02:26:58,524
You are right,

2289
02:26:58,604 --> 02:27:09,000
if you feel a little misfit or if you feel that you're unable to see your friends.

2290
02:27:10,410 --> 02:27:14,770
the same way as you did before hearing those stories. So I think you're being a little judgmental.

2291
02:27:14,850 --> 02:27:22,530
People do make silly mistakes and most of these sounded like mistakes which people make.

2292
02:27:22,610 --> 02:27:29,010
I'm sure a few years down the line they will get their act together and be a little more responsible.

